{"4205590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "We Are The Wall", "steam_appid": 4205590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/d2402a401f33d3ed7b183a379e9fcc5c.poster.avif?t=1778508724\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/d2402a401f33d3ed7b183a379e9fcc5c.webm?t=1778508724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/d2402a401f33d3ed7b183a379e9fcc5c.mp4?t=1778508724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/762e62b46b8dd75f60752c501ee3c3e2.avif?t=1778508724\" width=800 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For ages, the dwarves have defended their mountain and its sacred heart. But fallen clans, now cursed, seek to drag all others into the realm of the forgotten. These dwarves lack all emotion, have abandoned all bonds of fellowship, and will do anything to claim your mountain. Build your base and stand against them—your mountain <strong>must not fall.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/036dd8c724f20b8aef4f5c7706977af6.poster.avif?t=1778508724\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/036dd8c724f20b8aef4f5c7706977af6.webm?t=1778508724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/036dd8c724f20b8aef4f5c7706977af6.mp4?t=1778508724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/611b9789b2fde03905005f8fc1b8425e.avif?t=1778508724\" width=800 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lands are rich with resources—<strong>wood, stone, food, and more.</strong> Gather them by hand early on, then <i>automate</i> production as your settlement grows. Once your economy is running, turn your focus to <i>hunting down enemy encampments</i>, strengthening your defenses, and preparing for the <u>harsh days ahead</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/7c72b130eb5b2d5542a42e225cf3c18d.poster.avif?t=1778508724\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/7c72b130eb5b2d5542a42e225cf3c18d.webm?t=1778508724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/7c72b130eb5b2d5542a42e225cf3c18d.mp4?t=1778508724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/85c51d0dcd8295a299351057e2e9053e.avif?t=1778508724\" width=800 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The farther you venture from your mountain, the more <strong>dangerous</strong> the lands become—but the <i>rewards grow just as steeply</i>. Decide whether the risk is worth the riches, or stay closer to home for safer, smaller gains. Rare resources lie in the outer regions, enabling <strong>stronger units, new buildings, and powerful upgrades.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/c75094ab8a8d88a75ca671273164140f.poster.avif?t=1778508724\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/c75094ab8a8d88a75ca671273164140f.webm?t=1778508724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/c75094ab8a8d88a75ca671273164140f.mp4?t=1778508724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/ce19918a7cc7de8710bd119d1e81b35b.avif?t=1778508724\" width=800 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each passing day, enemy forces grow <strong>stronger in the shadows</strong>, ready to strike in larger and more frequent waves. Only by training brave dwarves and building solid defenses can you withstand the assault and survive the coming onslaught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/c599b5f9e4027a6a0c209cb8bb57a3aa.poster.avif?t=1778508724\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/c599b5f9e4027a6a0c209cb8bb57a3aa.webm?t=1778508724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/c599b5f9e4027a6a0c209cb8bb57a3aa.mp4?t=1778508724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/72f8a508b9438dcac8f305e45593a66e.avif?t=1778508724\" width=800 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your primary goal is to <u><strong>defend the mountain</strong></u>—<i>its heart is sacred to the dwarves</i> of your settlement. But survival isn’t just about defense; <i>maintaining a good relationship with the mountain itself is <strong>crucial</strong></i>. If your people go hungry or fail to honor the heart, consequences will follow. Keep it pleased, however, and you may be rewarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/ee133d2211f754ccd7709e9484e0abfb.avif?t=1778508724\" width=500 height=325 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/d2402a401f33d3ed7b183a379e9fcc5c.poster.avif?t=1778508724\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/d2402a401f33d3ed7b183a379e9fcc5c.webm?t=1778508724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/d2402a401f33d3ed7b183a379e9fcc5c.mp4?t=1778508724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/762e62b46b8dd75f60752c501ee3c3e2.avif?t=1778508724\" width=800 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For ages, the dwarves have defended their mountain and its sacred heart. But fallen clans, now cursed, seek to drag all others into the realm of the forgotten. These dwarves lack all emotion, have abandoned all bonds of fellowship, and will do anything to claim your mountain. Build your base and stand against them—your mountain <strong>must not fall.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/036dd8c724f20b8aef4f5c7706977af6.poster.avif?t=1778508724\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/036dd8c724f20b8aef4f5c7706977af6.webm?t=1778508724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/036dd8c724f20b8aef4f5c7706977af6.mp4?t=1778508724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/611b9789b2fde03905005f8fc1b8425e.avif?t=1778508724\" width=800 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lands are rich with resources—<strong>wood, stone, food, and more.</strong> Gather them by hand early on, then <i>automate</i> production as your settlement grows. Once your economy is running, turn your focus to <i>hunting down enemy encampments</i>, strengthening your defenses, and preparing for the <u>harsh days ahead</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/7c72b130eb5b2d5542a42e225cf3c18d.poster.avif?t=1778508724\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/7c72b130eb5b2d5542a42e225cf3c18d.webm?t=1778508724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/7c72b130eb5b2d5542a42e225cf3c18d.mp4?t=1778508724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/85c51d0dcd8295a299351057e2e9053e.avif?t=1778508724\" width=800 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The farther you venture from your mountain, the more <strong>dangerous</strong> the lands become—but the <i>rewards grow just as steeply</i>. Decide whether the risk is worth the riches, or stay closer to home for safer, smaller gains. Rare resources lie in the outer regions, enabling <strong>stronger units, new buildings, and powerful upgrades.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/c75094ab8a8d88a75ca671273164140f.poster.avif?t=1778508724\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/c75094ab8a8d88a75ca671273164140f.webm?t=1778508724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/c75094ab8a8d88a75ca671273164140f.mp4?t=1778508724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/ce19918a7cc7de8710bd119d1e81b35b.avif?t=1778508724\" width=800 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each passing day, enemy forces grow <strong>stronger in the shadows</strong>, ready to strike in larger and more frequent waves. Only by training brave dwarves and building solid defenses can you withstand the assault and survive the coming onslaught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/c599b5f9e4027a6a0c209cb8bb57a3aa.poster.avif?t=1778508724\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/c599b5f9e4027a6a0c209cb8bb57a3aa.webm?t=1778508724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/c599b5f9e4027a6a0c209cb8bb57a3aa.mp4?t=1778508724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras/72f8a508b9438dcac8f305e45593a66e.avif?t=1778508724\" width=800 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your primary goal is to <u><strong>defend the mountain</strong></u>—<i>its heart is sacred to the dwarves</i> of your settlement. But survival isn’t just about defense; <i>maintaining a good relationship with the mountain itself is <strong>crucial</strong></i>. If your people go hungry or fail to honor the heart, consequences will follow. Keep it pleased, however, and you may be rewarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205590/extras